Decided 2026-05-07 (architecture · do not re-propose):
```
single-tenant per install · each Romanian SME gets their own server · no shared SaaS
no login system in MVP · one business owner per installation = one user by definition
same codebase · different servers · /demo is the same app pointed at synthetic data
slice-6 = package the app for VPS install · NOT mode flags · NOT auth scaffolds · NOT tenant config
open service-model question (parked · not technical): self-install vs install-for-them
```

